{
  "key": 19964,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_B_Academy_Text_LectureBStudent",
      "en_US": [
        "Since Foxglove’s lecture, my\n",
        "Earthquake hasn’t hit my own\r",
        "partner once. Well… twice."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_B_Academy_Text_TeacherMenu",
      "en_US": "What shall we do?"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_B_Academy_Text_OptDemo",
      "en_US": "Demo Battle"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_B_Academy_Text_OptLecture",
      "en_US": "the Lecture"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_B_Academy_Text_OptBye",
      "en_US": "That’s All"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_B_Academy_Text_FoxgloveLecture0",
      "en_US": [
        "Foxglove: Spread moves. My\n",
        "favorite subject."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_B_Academy_Text_FoxgloveLecture1",
      "en_US": [
        "Earthquake, Rock Slide, Heat\n",
        "Wave, Dazzling Gleam, Muddy\r",
        "Water, Hyper Voice: they hit\n",
        "both foes at once.\r",
        "A spread move does three\n",
        "quarters of its damage to each\r",
        "target. Two hits for the price\n",
        "of one!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_B_Academy_Text_FoxgloveLecture2",
      "en_US": [
        "Careful: Earthquake and Surf hit\n",
        "your partner too. Pair them with\r",
        "a Flying type, a Levitate user,\n",
        "or a Pokémon that absorbs Water.\r",
        "Or have the partner Protect on\n",
        "the turn you fire it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_B_Academy_Text_FoxgloveLecture3",
      "en_US": [
        "Wide Guard blocks spread moves\n",
        "for your whole side. And Rock\r",
        "Slide’s flinches add up fast.\r",
        "In doubles, the best damage is\n",
        "damage everywhere!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_B_Academy_Text_VerbenaLecture0",
      "en_US": [
        "Verbena: Positioning and\n",
        "switching. Let’s go!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_B_Academy_Text_VerbenaLecture1",
      "en_US": [
        "In doubles, what’s on the field\n",
        "next to what matters as much as\r",
        "the Pokémon themselves.\r",
        "Parting Shot, U-Turn and Volt\n",
        "Switch bring in the right\r",
        "partner. Fake out can be used\n",
        "again each time a Pokémon comes\r",
        "back in."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_B_Academy_Text_VerbenaLecture2",
      "en_US": [
        "Intimidate lowers both foes’\n",
        "Attack every time its Pokémon\r",
        "comes in. Switch it out and back\n",
        "to do it again.\r",
        "Regenerator heals on every\n",
        "switch. A Pokémon in the back is\r",
        "a Pokémon resting."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_B_Academy_Text_VerbenaLecture3",
      "en_US": [
        "Protect buys time for a switch\n",
        "on the other side. And watch for\r",
        "a slot the foe is about to\n",
        "double up on.\r",
        "Move your pieces before they\n",
        "move you!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_B_Academy_Text_DemoIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: A demonstration! A\n",
        "double battle, and we both use\r",
        "rentals, three each.\r",
        "My team shows off the lesson.\n",
        "Choose yours wisely!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_B_gGymChallengeIntroText",
      "en_US": "(missing text)"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_B_Academy_Text_DemoWon",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Wonderful! Here,\n",
        "you’ve earned it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_B_Academy_Text_RentalReturn",
      "en_US": [
        "Your own Pokémon are back with\n",
        "you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_B_Academy_Text_DemoLost",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Ha! Think about the\n",
        "lesson and try again."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_B_Academy_Text_EarnedBP",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} earned {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} BP!\n",
        "(Total: {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} BP)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_B_cv_unported",
      "en_US": [
        "(Canvas DS: this part of the game\n",
        "isn’t ported yet.)"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
